<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mycom 6-mth net down 48 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mycom 6-mth net down 48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	 5.0	vs	10.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		  17.92     vs	34.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		   629.75     vs     368.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    60.71     vs	62.96</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 25.75     vs less 14.17</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Mycom Bhd. It is involved in gaming, hotel, property investment and development, plantation and stockbroking.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
